From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fryezero <108418382+fryezero@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:35:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] mu: GFx TextField extensions (appendHtml, textAutoSize,
 verticalAlign)

appendHtml(html) appends to the field's HTML; textAutoSize "shrink" scales
the laid-out text down until it fits the field, "fit" scales it to fill
it (the text is laid out again at width / scale so its alignment holds);
verticalAlign "center"/"bottom" offsets the text inside the field.
hitTestDisable and shadowColor exist as plain properties.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 core/src/avm1/globals/text_field.rs  | 82 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 core/src/display_object/edit_text.rs | 98 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 178 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/src/avm1/globals/text_field.rs b/core/src/avm1/globals/text_field.rs
